{"server":"tw","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_03_beg","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_03","title":"禮拜","storyCode":"MT-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"b25eb65bffe5b3154e3fc0a680c3ce7112714d911fda343f2b64d90b84b49d73","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在蘭登修道院服刑的阿爾圖羅設法逃脫，費德里科前去追緝。與此同時，能天使計劃透過混入難民隊伍的方式，潛入育嬰聖堂。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"龍門，“大地的盡頭”酒吧"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，你竟然在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你不是也在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酒吧又沒營業，你來幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道為什麼就來到這裡了，說不定這是社畜的天性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"來都來了，就打掃一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，等一下我自己整理就好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看都是給我的禮物，就順便拆開了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水晶球？拜松這小子——等等，峯馳物流已經把生意擴展到察帕特了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼厚一疊可以一起使用的折價券？“買得越多，折扣越大；折扣越大，買得越多”……可頌是想讓我搬空整個商場嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Sora敘拉古巡迴演唱會LIVE專輯《不期而會》……空是不是忘了多寄兩張門票？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"狂歡節假面，這肯定是德克薩斯送的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，有點緊，需要改良！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個軟刷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆到底是送我禮物，還是把他保養黑膠唱片的工具寄給員工啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了伊斯，你看這個軟刷到底是用什麼毛做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"……看起來有點像魯珀的毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，狂歡節早就結束了，老闆和德克薩斯怎麼還待在新沃爾西尼？我從薩爾貢回來，店裡竟然一個人都沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯說是留在那邊準備企鵝物流的新業務，至於大帝先生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"他和他的朋友們，有些別的事情要處理——除了做唱片辦派對教育員工……之外的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懂了，那跟你報備也是一樣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下啦，我快填好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"填什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休假申請單！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想休一個很長很長的假，所以還是按照規定處理一下比較好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該知道我為什麼專門接了薩爾貢的訂單吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢……那是莫斯提馬作為萬國信使負責的區域之一吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這次見到莫斯提馬，她說，那個讓姐姐和她變成如今這個樣子的傢伙，那個姐姐希望永遠不會再出現的人，回到了拉特蘭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐的病還沒有完全好，但她已經加入了教皇廳。秘密也好，真相也好，當年的事情把他們重新捲在了一起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我當年本就是為了知道這些才來龍門的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"你要回拉特蘭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！總不能什麼都不做就在龍門等著姐姐來看我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯、空、拜松、可頌……甚至是最不可靠的老闆，如今大家都有自己的事情要忙，天下沒有不散的筵席啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“不忘初心”——這是我們企鵝物流的企業文化哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"每日更新的企業文化……不過說的也沒錯啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我保管好這些禮物，轉告我的朋友們，等所有事情都搞定的時候，我就會回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_035","isRemote":false,"text":"接你的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不是啊！我才剛做的決定！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們……怎麼了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這個，辦事處剛剛收到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本艦的緊急機密文件？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"累死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易千里迢迢回來一趟，結果怪事一件接著一件，讓人忙得暈頭轉向！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰能想到一輛看似不具威脅的告解車，會是頂尖的情報員呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"做得不錯，拍拍你的音響以示鼓勵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但有了梵妮的幫助，我們製造出的炸彈現在至少能一次炸斷三根柱子了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然還是很不夠看啦，但只要選對了柱子，用這樣的炸彈也能炸毀一整棟樓！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈……我如果說自己是每天都想去瞻仰一番的狂熱支持者，肯定不會被放進去吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過沒關係！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有困難，那就創造方法；沒有困難，那就創造困難！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“從不接無聊的訂單”——這是我們企鵝物流優秀的企業文化哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是我老姐，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我只會更有動力啦，就算是為了早點見到老姐，也要快點把問題解決！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小樂姐，該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，梵妮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i03_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我和她沒見過幾次，但唯獨在這件事上，我確定可以相信她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在擔心什麼，但……哎呀，我很難向你解釋薩科塔之間的連結，總之，放心好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g3_nurserytemplecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安撫鈴為什麼一直響個不停？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是前面那兩間育嬰室……奇怪，應該有其他保育員專門負責才對……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"走廊兩側的巨型奶瓶突然倒塌，安多恩被砸暈了過去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是暈了，沒死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底是什麼樣的嬰兒用得到這麼大的奶瓶？這種東西要是砸在成年馱獸的頭上，我猜連馱獸都會腦震盪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，省得多費口舌，鬧出更大的動靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_364_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來怎麼辦？繼續往裡面看看，還是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我總覺得這裡很不對勁……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你負責搬他，其他人警戒，我們原路返回，趕快離開這個鬼地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大還在外面等著呢。等這個傢伙醒了，我們再一起好好問個清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是憑空起了一陣風，那些原本安靜懸於走廊和育嬰室內的安撫鈴突然鈴聲大作。\n那絕不是用來哄孩童入睡的聲音，它連綿不絕，刺耳得如同警報。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闖入者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_362_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警報解除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清理現場，以免孩子們看見。將安多恩保育員送回房間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g4_nurseryindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您醒了，安多恩前輩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛發生什麼事情了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有闖入者。放心，巡邏守衛們及時發現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來您的感覺沒有錯，之前在街上，確實有人跟蹤您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的目標是我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是被選中的保育員，對方的目標應該是接下來的降生儀式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闖入者的身分是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過是一些迷路的人罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼……迷路的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是指，我不清楚他們的身分，調查工作會由其他同僚負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩前輩，您最清楚降生儀式的重要性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以請一定要注意安全，好好休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有受到驚嚇吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不安地喘息）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靠在我的手臂上就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別怕，別怕……那只是安撫鈴在響。這裡不會有那些可怕的聲音……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有獵人的哨響，不會有牙獸的吠叫，也不會再有源石潮的轟鳴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（微弱地呻吟）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，我一直在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感受到，你是多麼強烈地想帶著腹中的小生命一起活下去……我也如此希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快，很快……所有人都會如此希望。所有人都將不再爭鬥，所有人都將成為樂園的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都將與你同行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"31_g3_mini12_farmland"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，她就這麼不見了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我們割完了那邊的小麥，午餐結束後我讓大家休息，她說想要拉一下琴，我、我同意了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一個人走到了這邊背風的田埂，因為離得不遠，大家一直能聽見她的琴聲，我也就、就沒有多想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後等你過來叫她時，她卻不見蹤影了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"靈異事件？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚慌的修女","speakerId":"avg_npc_370_1","isRemote":false,"text":"席德佳，在修道院的門口發生靈異事件……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在電影裡確實是很經典的橋段啦……啊，我的意思是，先別緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽，提琴聲還是很清晰……阿爾圖羅小姐說不定只是拉著琴走到麥田深處去了，音樂家的想法總是難以捉摸的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶人去前面接著找，這裡交給我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"修女，去看看麥田裡的其他稻草人，它們的脖頸處應該會有和這個相似的裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公證所執行者費德里科，前來例行探視受監者阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的執行者攤開手心，一隻摺紙蜻蜓停在上面，翅膀正有規律地振動，搧出悠揚的琴聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紙、紙蜻蜓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一種音樂術式。受監者應該是在萊塔尼亞旅居期間掌握了此種技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她用的還是……《聖徒行記》的書頁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個細節並不重要，修女。毫無疑問，阿爾圖羅已經脫離了監管狀態——她越獄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我……我其實已經猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執行者先生，阿爾圖羅小姐是很重要的人對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果重要程度是根據公證所從發布通緝令到將她逮捕所投入的資源來判斷——是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭登修道院重新被教皇廳委以重任才沒過多久，我們好不容易擺脫了財政危機……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（而且已經被這個突然冒出來的執行者給抓了個現行，想要偷偷把阿爾圖羅小姐抓回來應該也不可能了……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都聽見了，修女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總、總之，我得快點向教皇廳彙報這件事情才行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下，修女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公證所將接手此次案件。阿爾圖羅之前就是我親自逮捕的，我會在她造成任何實際的危害前將她追捕回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，蘭登修道院無需另行上報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這不符合規定吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了……執行者先生，你沒有想過上報，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來就覺得太巧了——你就是為了這件事來的，你猜到了阿爾圖羅小姐會越獄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無可奉告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅小姐之前也是像你一樣，好像發現了什麼，說了一些神神秘秘的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執行者先生，如果你不讓我上報，那我必須跟著你一起，將阿爾圖羅小姐追捕回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭登修道院對我非常非常重要，我不能讓它受到牽連。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"執行者的手指靈巧地翻動著，那隻紙蜻蜓在轉瞬間變回了一張皺巴巴的書頁，悠揚的提琴聲消失了，田野歸於寂靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保留證據……但它這樣一直發出聲響會妨礙我們調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修女，你的申請合乎執行者操作手冊的規定。執行者判斷，同意你協助追查受監者。走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"席德佳","speakerId":"avg_npc_1784_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你和阿爾圖羅小姐還真是各有各的奇怪啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然每天都能看到它陰魂不散地立在那裡，但從這裡看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也！太！高！了！吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些像鱗鰓一樣的薄片是什麼……這種像骨頭一樣的管道通往哪裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牆面上這個流動的顏色又是怎麼回事？像是吃了用肥皂水煮出來的藍莓布丁之後嘔吐物的顏色……有點噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小樂姐，你是怎麼知道……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我上學的時候某次不太成功的惡作劇啦。雖然不是什麼很好的回憶，但現在反而令人有些懷念了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少那個時候大家分得清楚惡作劇和正事，不會無比虔誠地搞出這種像巨大器官一樣的古怪建築。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這個地方好熟悉。我以前一定來過，只是我也搞不清楚這裡原來是麵包坊、禮拜堂還是彈藥市集了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像這座巨大的聖堂一直都在這裡似的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種感覺真，奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭痛嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，這種事情很好理解啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像有一家你最愛的甜點店，你每隔幾天就會去光顧一下，為了辦派對，或者單純是自己想吃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天你偶然經過，當然也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你買了一塊千層酥，突然覺得口味好像哪裡不太一樣了，你懷疑是不是店裡換了甜點師，抬頭一看，發現其實連店面都換新的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像就是這樣自然而然產生的變化，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是這樣……小樂姐好厲害。我完全沒辦法像這樣把自己的感受說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那塊千層酥的味道，又是從什麼時候開始變的呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我也不知道！好像我從龍門回來的時候就變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從接駁港辦完手續出來一抬頭，就看到那座聖堂已經立在那裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，對哦！這麼大的聖堂，我從城外怎麼完全沒看到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓——小樂姐——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看那邊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全體巡邏守衛，列陣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三隊一組，三小時一輪，交叉巡邏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛A","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潛入聖堂內部，襲擊保育員……類似的事情絕不能再次發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖堂巡邏守衛B","speakerId":"avg_npc_1788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞭解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在戍衛隊的制服風格也這麼……別緻了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這個鱗皮一樣的披風……難道是育嬰聖堂自己的衛兵？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多人……我還沒想到辦法呢，他們倒是先把路都堵死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小樂姐，怎麼辦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了，各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"添頭就是被送到這裡面養胎了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，如果各位想要探望她，我們會視情況安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖堂已經安排了專門的保育員負責全程照顧添頭女士。分娩之前，她都將得到最好的照料，不會受到任何驚擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們這些人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲林","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十三座移動修道院，裡面收容的傷員至少也有上千人，你們用來臨時安置的安布羅修區壓根沒有那麼多醫院和療養院……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬國峰會期間，拉特蘭萬眾雲集，目前的醫療資源非常吃緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯珀","speakerId":"avg_npc_696_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照規定，我們提前收容一位需要救治的孕婦，已經屬於特殊情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但各位願意來到這裡，是基於對拉特蘭的信任。我們絕不會置之不理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本降生儀式結束後，育嬰聖堂才會正式對外開放，此刻裡面的絕大多數房間暫時空置，且保育員們都具備基本的醫護資格……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牧首已經專門和教皇廳打過招呼，這段時間，育嬰聖堂願意臨時收治需要診療的異族朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會有巡邏守衛帶各位前往各自的房間……接下來還會有幾波傷員陸續抵達，我需要留在這裡接應他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"保育員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主賜福拉特蘭，主賜福眾生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g1_nurserytemplesquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_1041_angel2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，現在不就有辦法了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梵里妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1779_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小樂姐，你不會是想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
